{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>&quot;There is no God anymore \u2013</i> <br><i>Satan sits upon His throne.</i> <br><i>But hope for salvation is not yet lost,</i> <br><i>as long as one warrior of God still breathes.&quot;</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379230/extras/BB_one_gif___2_.gif?t=1748889436\" /></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>MISSION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You play as the last priest, descending into the deepest depths to destroy the very essence of evil. Your path is filled with traps, lava, and fear.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379230/extras/BB_one_gif___7_.gif?t=1748889436\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>GAMEPLAY STYLE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Playing fast and aggressive or slow and steady\u00a0<i>\u2013</i> entirely up to you. Master your platforming skills while investigating the lore of the devil's adobe and collecting infernal relics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379230/extras/BB_one_gif___3_.gif?t=1748889436\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>SKILLS UPGRADE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use Bless Points to upgrade movement skills.\u00a0Bless Points are awarded for completing levels and collecting full relics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379230/extras/BB_one_gif__8_.gif?t=1748889436\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FEATURING</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">10 levels <i>\u2013</i> from mushroom caves to brutalist megastructures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2 hours for a first playthrough</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">global ranking <i>\u2013</i> compete with other players in level completion speed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">horror-infused religious atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">deconstructivist, brutalist, and infernal architecture</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">retro visuals with a modern flair</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">unique soundtrack <i>\u2013</i> a fusion of church choirs, ritual percussion, and industrial sound</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> devil\u2019s suspenseful monologues</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">movement skill upgrade system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">collecting infernal relics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">sliding on colossal roots</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">riding giant snakes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2379230?t=1748889436","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2379230?t=1748889436","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379230/8a5814d029b07b9b5436f19b1c02a67916b397fb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748889436","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379230/8a5814d029b07b9b5436f19b1c02a67916b397fb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748889436","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"The game contains gore and violence. "},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>&quot;There is no God anymore \u2013</i> <br><i>Satan sits upon His throne.</i> <br><i>But hope for salvation is not yet lost,</i> <br><i>as long as one warrior of God still breathes.&quot;</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379230/extras/BB_one_gif___2_.gif?t=1748889436\" /></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>MISSION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You play as the last priest, descending into the deepest depths to destroy the very essence of evil. Your path is filled with traps, lava, and fear.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379230/extras/BB_one_gif___7_.gif?t=1748889436\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>GAMEPLAY STYLE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Playing fast and aggressive or slow and steady\u00a0<i>\u2013</i> entirely up to you. Master your platforming skills while investigating the lore of the devil's adobe and collecting infernal relics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379230/extras/BB_one_gif___3_.gif?t=1748889436\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>SKILLS UPGRADE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use Bless Points to upgrade movement skills.\u00a0Bless Points are awarded for completing levels and collecting full relics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379230/extras/BB_one_gif__8_.gif?t=1748889436\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FEATURING</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">10 levels <i>\u2013</i> from mushroom caves to brutalist megastructures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2 hours for a first playthrough</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">global ranking <i>\u2013</i> compete with other players in level completion speed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">horror-infused religious atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">deconstructivist, brutalist, and infernal architecture</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">retro visuals with a modern flair</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">unique soundtrack <i>\u2013</i> a fusion of church choirs, ritual percussion, and industrial sound</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> devil\u2019s suspenseful monologues</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">movement skill upgrade system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">collecting infernal relics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">sliding on colossal roots</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">riding giant snakes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul>","developers":["Podoba Interactive"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379230/f41247ebb4b6d1e38899f84f1bdcec831f6467c8/header.jpg?t=1748889436","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257148467,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257148467/movie480.mp4?t=1748620383","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257148467/movie_max.mp4?t=1748620383"},"name":"Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257148467/9b7a7f4a7d1ffb075b675f30be92febd4d5e2b00/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1748620383","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257148467/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1748620383","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257148467/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1748620383"}}],"name":"Blessed Burden","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7, 10, 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 1030<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1500 MB available space</li></ul>","recommen